# 25-omr submodule: declared in .gitmodules but its upstream repo is ~3GB
# (far more than the ~90MB of checkpoints this project actually needs), so
# local working copies of it are not tracked here. Run
# `git submodule update --init` (or manually copy the checkpoint files
# documented in README.md) to populate it.
/25-omr/
